Description: Provides the ROBOSRMSMOTE (Robust Oversampling with RM-SMOTE) framework for imbalanced 
    classification tasks. This package extends Mahalanobis distance-based 
    oversampling techniques by integrating robust covariance estimators to 
    better handle outliers and complex data distributions. The implemented 
    methodology builds upon and significantly expands the RM-SMOTE algorithm 
    originally proposed by Taban et al. (2025) <doi:10.1007/s10260-025-00819-8>.
